Well, yes; but consider: you would have lost those points _anyway_ as 
soon as someone else broke the tie by ascending (since it was only a tie 
because there were so few ascensions on the board).  The scoreboard 
always fluctuates wildly at the beginning since, as you demonstrated, 
whoever gets the first ascension trophy will for a short time hold _all_ 
the ascension-based trophies.  ;-)

There is (as far as I know) only one case where you can genuinely hurt 
your clan score by ascending, and that's if you move up the recognition 
tiers but lose your "with Bells On" multiplier.  We're trying to come up 
with a way to fix that.

